  "specId": "323-child-process-failure-results",
  "issue": 444,
  "request": "Goal: Preserve and report typed child-process execution failures in the default test runner and final-regression so the primary cause is diagnosable from one log. Scope: tests/run.js, src/flow/lib/test-regression.js, and focused contract tests/fixtures for ENOENT, SIGKILL, timeout, ERR_CHILD_PROCESS_STDIO_MAXBUFFER, assertion failure, and happy path. Out of Scope: test selection, general preset/label summaries, Issue #443 flow transition/review/finalize changes, and other board items. Acceptance: retain command, exit code, signal, stderr/stdout summaries, execution state, exclude unexecuted suites from PASS aggregation, and preserve ordinary assertion semantics.",
